Frozen Responsibilities
File(s)    Responsibility
level001-008.json    Chapter 1: Amara's Home; level001 introduces the board and case file
level009-015.json    Chapter 2: Village Road; level009 introduces obstacles
level016-022.json    Chapter 3: Technician's Office; level016 introduces rocket creation
level023-030.json    Chapter 4: Police Station; level023 introduces padlocks
level031-040.json    Chapter 5: Forest Path; level031 introduces hazards
level041-049.json    Chapter 6 challenge and story resolution setup
level050.json    Rescue confrontation and opening-campaign finale
This freezes the JSON schema and responsibilities for every file under:

levels/

All gameplay systems (such as LevelManager, BoardGenerator, RewardManager, StoryManager, and BoardManager) should read level data from this schema without requiring changes to the file format during Version 1.
